<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1353_4691.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> willig dienst zuvor, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Frombe</unclear>,
